  <p class="gd-lede">Most first heli-ski trips go wonderfully, but the ones that fall short usually do so for a handful of avoidable reasons, and every one of them is easy to sidestep once you know it. From overstating your ability to booking the wrong insurance, here are the common heli-skiing mistakes first-timers make and exactly how to avoid them, so your trip lands the way it should, before you look at <a href="/packages">the packages</a>.</p>
